{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5451e30e1dc70514d4f388e63df4e08803c2ff2bf07d141ad6dff0052533b047", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のパジャマ特集に、\n亜利沙が参戦！　撮影は順調に進んでいる……）", "zh": "（亚利沙也参加了写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣特辑！拍摄进行得很顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6c445cfd3f9a457ef6ee72d4454d88debbbc82af5232e5dec03cdb995d98de6e", "ja": "亜利沙、お疲れ様。いい写真が沢山撮れてるって、\nカメラマンさんが褒めてたぞ。", "zh": "亚利沙，辛苦了。摄影师夸你说，已经拍出了很多很棒的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "c74855b86199f0d0f46afc83bbd5c968976c4b2adbecd282b28e6b63f027fa88", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？　ありさは、いつも寝る前に\nしてることを、やってただけなんですけど……。", "zh": "真、真的吗！？　我只是做了平时睡前会做的事而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5699b1c69648a019c26fefc4c3079653d7a6dbc92f95e6de12d279ac4df92ada", "ja": "その自然さがよかったんだろうな。アイドルの動画を\n見てるシーンとか、いかにも亜利沙らしかったよ。", "zh": "那种自然感才是亮点吧。比如看偶像视频的场景，就非常符合亜利沙的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "7ecde5ea556d3b0375af4222bec86cc9e617a3dc9a27dd011ece3fee7c7561cf", "ja": "えへへ。あれは、ありさにとって、大事な大事な\nナイトルーティンのひとつなんです！", "zh": "嘿嘿。那可是对亚利沙来说，非常非常重要的夜间习惯之一！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "292c66c3a61193bcedc79a85f1ed1875d7e30ae306a3d3cf94f52ae590b21e1d", "ja": "アイドルちゃん達の新しい動画をチェックしない\nことには、ありさの一日は終わりませんから！", "zh": "不查看偶像们的新视频，亚利纱的一天就没法结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "1fea7dbf8067141a8dd9417ccc73f8abac652d878d1c81af639d8a7e11d33252", "ja": "最近のアイドルちゃんは、メイクとかスキンケアの\n動画も上げてくれたり……見ごたえがあって！", "zh": "最近的偶像们，还会上传化妆啊、护肤之类的视频……真的很值得看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c67f8953141bc20b5bd80bfc1954deb265c4f40007ef757b861ec4da08c8d186", "ja": "ああ、なんか色々あるみたいだよな……。\n全部見るのは、大変なんじゃないか？", "zh": "啊，好像确实有各种各样的内容……。\n要全部看完，应该挺不容易的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "7c9330b8784df6d26bc8c5b006e4a10c2e46c555d82ed2e68f9cb9162d98c28f", "ja": "いえ、ちっとも！　アイドルちゃん達の\nプライベートが垣間見えて、もう最高なんですっ！", "zh": "不，一点也不！能窥见偶像们的\n私生活，简直棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "27ce32caa898b8a53079464ea5cc7cf6924f0b000db6d658b207df513a3e27f4", "ja": "ありさ思わず、オススメされたスキンケア\nセット、買い揃えちゃいました。ムフフ♪", "zh": "亚利沙忍不住把大家推荐的护肤\n套装全都买齐了。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "58025513791eedd07f586e7d1e8b1e4ddd141de95180f9aa73fc8c3984ce6b84", "ja": "あ、ちなみに今日も持ってきてます！\nもしかしたら、撮影に使えるかもと思って……。", "zh": "啊，对了，今天也带来了！\n想着说不定拍摄时能用上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "06b4227ac565109f1d5cc36a0498336d4f2fcf7d33befac37eca27a70985e228", "ja": "撮影に？　なるほど……寝る前のスキンケアって、\nそれこそプライベートっぽいシーンだし。いいかもな！", "zh": "拍摄用的？原来如此……睡前护肤，确实是很有私下氛围的场景。不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "12bb8ae8d0d4436477732a7452e8860c48ee1e550052e2ce34e6cfcaf6d20b7a", "ja": "ふ、ふおおぉっ、さすが{$P$}さん！\nありさの狙いを、すぐわかってくれるとは……！", "zh": "呜、呜哦哦哦，真不愧是{$P$}先生！\n居然马上就明白了亚利沙的意图……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5fef8fcfbde90e445c4520b27ba64f3b2ad2b85b544b8f473a18fc5242b56670", "ja": "まあ、それくらいはわかるよ。じゃあさっそく、\nスタッフ達に提案しに行ってみるかな。", "zh": "嘛，这点我还是明白的。那我现在就去向工作人员提议一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "0dadf033c4548c32fc6a8c9ddac8dfa7974c888a574b6ba5e57c728c777fb755", "ja": "わかりましたっ！\nソースの用意は、ありさにお任せくださいっ！", "zh": "明白了！\n准备素材的事，就交给亚利沙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "dc2653d2145e4dbf4600010188ada8a66b162f144f1d39d005d9e324ec4b9bcc", "ja": "アイドルちゃん達の参考動画なら、\n幾らでもご用意できますので……ムフフっ♪", "zh": "偶像们的参考视频，要多少我都能准备……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0283_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2ebf4dc98e42f7237ce0b9c1be347e7c6f05541eb34429f42c2a4884ca3c5ddc", "ja": "（その後、スタッフ達もノッてくれて、最高の一枚が\n完成した……やったな、亜利沙！）", "zh": "（之后，工作人员也跟着兴奋起来，完成了最棒的一张照片……干得好，亚利沙！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
